    <region left="20" top="1523" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">If P11 is right but a later ln() or fractional power fails, the unit tag from abs() is the cause - SMath pitfall 3 of README.txt.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1570" width="1560" height="27" color="#0f2a44" fontSize="12" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 12px;">P12  acos rewritten with atan                    expected 1.0472 / 2.0944</p>
      </content>
