    <region left="20" top="6933" width="470" height="25" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- f.sw at theta = 0.05, must be 86.05 kHz:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="6933" width="1080" height="39" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="2">
      <input>
        <e type="operand">p.25a</e>
        <e type="operand">f.p25</e>
        <e type="operand">1</e>
        <e type="function" args="2">el</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">86.05</e>
        </result>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="6980" width="470" height="25" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- f.sw at the line peak, must be 108.48 kHz:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="6980" width="1080" height="39" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="2">
      <input>
        <e type="operand">p.25b</e>
        <e type="operand">f.p25</e>
        <e type="operand">5</e>
        <e type="function" args="2">el</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">108.48</e>
        </result>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="7043" width="1560" height="27" color="#0f2a44" fontSize="12" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 12px;">P26  every step of P25 at the line peak     the FIRST wrong one is the answer</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="7078" width="1560" height="51" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">P21 to P24 pass and P25 overflows, so no single construct is at fault and the value goes wrong along the chain. Each row reads ONE element of one intermediate at k = 5, where theta is pi/2, and states what it must be. The first disagreement names the step.</p>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">If any of them prints a MATRIX instead of a number, then el() on the right-hand side is returning the whole vector rather than one element, and that alone would explain the overflow.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="7137" width="470" height="25" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- sin(theta), must be 1.000000:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="7137" width="1080" height="39" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="6">
      <input>
        <e type="operand">p.26a</e>
        <e type="operand">s.p25</e>
        <e type="operand">5</e>
        <e type="function" args="2">el</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">1.000000</e>
        </result>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="7184" width="470" height="25" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- Q(theta), must be 0.500148:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="7184" width="1080" height="39" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="6">
      <input>
